config YUKI_FS
	tristate "YukiFS filesystem support"
	depends on BLOCK
	default m
	help
	  YukiFS is a custom POSIX-flavoured FAT-like filesystem
	  (POSIX mode bits + uid/gid + atime/mtime/ctime, 64-char names).

	  To compile this filesystem support as a module, choose M here:
	  the module will be called yukifs.

	  If unsure, say N.

endmenu
